    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to believe that. like everyone else seems to have their people and their lives already figured out. i'm just taking up space. i don't see the point in trying so hard to force connections when it feels like the world would just keep spinning exactly the same way if i wasn't even in it.",
